5580066_333648485242175_7142114941362976780_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4R3E6qRfaNMQ7kNvwEIldtZ&_nc_oc=AdqO0zuKi26xf4J2-N94iz5sjjj-qKGIQKx2fIfW4jOpZdJ2Pg2LGb2-BalMM4xnKfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqgvF3Y6T-2ozl9IwlkFw5fatCiJHFw8nO6gnq-TGESA&oe=6AFB3021"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "895321564686677", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75302968_895321568020010_5297126940155273314_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eM4CBo8PSyoQ7kNvwEevx88&_nc_oc=AdrhYrli3qBvEYhPKQtSHFw1ci4A4pnoHLy-NHQgHrMfcqF2XGOdMh-R4E3YVVQ9bVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBoENIx1eqNuoFXvPwcsigpxpI1-wcsB9JdS9PD-yzhQ&oe=6AFB3CC1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OUAS_Landscape.png", "id": "964392504162072", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210889_964392507495405_8574370962776368180_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=srN_usa1rhEQ7kNvwG9u2-P&_nc_oc=Adrxy9u7gdfoQgvjjDFXuCg6Cs0AGXBH42v7eK2bfzCDFk1AKAtbnZZQwaPtjg_8tME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSQW24oWoy4VfCBPUEauy195NjBWZsP0M0mN7pd_J2lBQ&oe=6AFB163C"}, "display_name": "Once Upon a Sea - Ronit Hillel - The Muse", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The artist Ronit Hillel lives in a tiny one-room apartment full of paintings. Following a severe joint disease and after despairing of modern medicine, Ronit moved to Kibbutz Mitzpe Shalem at the foot of the Dead Sea. She left behind a large family, an embracing community, and an active studio, as she found a cure for her pains in the waters of the sea and the sulfur pools. But this natural remedy is in danger of extinction - following the receding of the sea and the closure of the beaches", "short_description": "\u201cOnce Upon a time, Earth\u2019s tectonic forces sculpture